            "text": "AI and GPU cluster builds are cabled with high-density MPO and MTP trunks between halls and rows, indoor rollable ribbon for backbone runs where pathway space is tight, and duplex LC patching at the rack. Send the fiber counts, polarity method and needed-by date and we will quote it as a build-to-order."
